{
  "name": "ld_straight_epoxy — ACI 318-19 25.4.2.4 straight-bar psi_e: congested 1.5 vs clear 1.2, psi_t*psi_e cap (AUDIT-FIXES A5, H3)",
  "comments": {
    "hand": [
      "ld = (3/40) * fy/(lambda*sqrt(f'c)) * (psi_t*psi_e*psi_s*psi_g / conf) * db, Ktr = 0, conf = min(2.5, cb/db).",
      "Base: (3/40)*60000/54.7722558 = 0.075*1095.4451150 = 82.1583836 in (per unit psi-product/conf, db = 1.0).",
      "Congested run: 4-#8 bottom bars, covers bot 3 / side 2, b_gb 24, epoxy: clear cover = min(3, 2) = 2 < 3db = 3",
      "  -> psi_e = 1.5 (clear spacing (24-4-1)/3 - 1 = 5.33 < 6db = 6 would ALSO trigger 1.5).",
      "  cb = min(3+0.5, 2+0.5, 6.33333/2) = 2.5 -> conf = 2.5. psi_t = 1.0 (bottom), psi_s = 1.0 (#8), psi_g = 1.0.",
      "  ld = 82.1583836 * (1.0*1.5*1.0*1.0)/2.5 = 49.2950302 in.",
      "Clear run: covers bot 3.25 / side 3.25, b_gb 30: clear cover = 3.25 >= 3db AND clear spacing = (30-6.5-1)/3 - 1 = 6.5 >= 6db",
      "  -> psi_e = 1.2. cb = min(3.75, 3.75, 3.75) = 3.75 -> conf = min(2.5, 3.75) = 2.5.",
      "  ld = 82.1583836 * 1.2/2.5 = 39.4360241 in.",
      "Cap psi_t*psi_e <= 1.7 (25.4.2.5): implemented in the engine (psiTE field). For BOTTOM bars psi_t = 1.0 so the",
      "cap cannot bind (max product 1.5); the engine's only top-bar ld paths (free-end, strip development) hard-code",
      "epoxy = false, so a binding 1.3*1.5 = 1.95 -> 1.7 case is not reachable through the public API. The psiTE",
      "assertions below verify the capped product field is computed and within 1.7; the cap logic itself is",
      "min(psi_t*psi_e, 1.7) in ldStraight (deep_beam_stm_engine.js)."
    ]
  },
  "runs": [
    {
      "name": "congested_psiE_15",
      "inputs": {
        "geometry": { "L_w_ft": 28.5, "x_L_ft": 1.25, "x_R_ft": 27.25, "lb_L_in": 30, "lb_R_in": 30, "t_w_in": 12, "h_w_ft": 14, "h_gb_in": 24, "b_gb_in": 24 },
        "loads": { "DL_super_plf": 5525, "LL_plf": 5205 },
        "materials": { "fc_psi": 3000, "fy_ksi": 60 },
        "reinf": { "tieBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "topBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "cover_bot_in": 3, "cover_side_in": 2, "cover_top_in": 2,
          "web": { "size": "#4", "s_in": 12, "layers": 2 },
          "anchorage": { "left": { "type": "straight", "epoxy": true }, "right": { "type": "straight", "epoxy": true } } }
      },
      "expect": { "status": "ok", "values": [
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ld.psiE", "value": 1.5, "atol": 0, "note": "clear cover 2 < 3db = 3 -> epoxy congested factor" },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ld.psiTE", "value": 1.5, "atol": 0, "note": "psi_t*psi_e = 1.0*1.5 = 1.5 <= 1.7 cap (cap not binding for bottom bars)" },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ld.l", "value": 49.29503017546495, "rtol": 1e-9, "note": "hand: 82.1583836*1.5/2.5 = 49.2950302 in" }
      ] }
    },
    {
      "name": "clear_psiE_12",
      "inputs": {
        "geometry": { "L_w_ft": 28.5, "x_L_ft": 1.25, "x_R_ft": 27.25, "lb_L_in": 30, "lb_R_in": 30, "t_w_in": 12, "h_w_ft": 14, "h_gb_in": 24, "b_gb_in": 30 },
        "loads": { "DL_super_plf": 5525, "LL_plf": 5205 },
        "materials": { "fc_psi": 3000, "fy_ksi": 60 },
        "reinf": { "tieBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "topBars": { "count": 4, "size": "#8" }, "cover_bot_in": 3.25, "cover_side_in": 3.25, "cover_top_in": 2,
          "web": { "size": "#4", "s_in": 12, "layers": 2 },
          "anchorage": { "left": { "type": "straight", "epoxy": true }, "right": { "type": "straight", "epoxy": true } } }
      },
      "expect": { "status": "ok", "values": [
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ld.psiE", "value": 1.2, "atol": 0, "note": "clear cover 3.25 >= 3db AND clear spacing 6.5 >= 6db -> epoxy uncongested" },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ld.psiTE", "value": 1.2, "atol": 0 },
        { "path": "checks[id=anchorage.L].contributions[0].ld.l", "value": 39.43602414037196, "rtol": 1e-9, "note": "hand: 82.1583836*1.2/2.5 = 39.4360241 in" }
      ] }
    }
  ]
}
